<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 700 mln 3-yr bonds on Jan 21. [corrected 15:40 gmt]</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 700 mln 3-yr bonds on Jan 21. [corrected 15:40 gmt]</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-01-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Poland will offer 700 (corrects from 300) million zlotys of floating three-year bonds on January 21, the central bank said.</p>
<p>It said the value date for paper will be February 3, 1997 and the bonds will mature on February 6, 2000.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
</text>
